<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5751" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφιγνοέω</span></b> : impf.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠμφεγνόουν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Sph.</u>
					236c
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				2.5.33
			</span></i>: aor.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠμφεγνόησα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Plt.</u>
					291b
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Sph.</u>
				228e
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφαγνοέω</span>
			v. l. in <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
			</span></i> l.c., and <i><span class="en">
				Procop.
				<u>Goth.</u>
				2.16
			</span></i>):—<i>to be doubtful</i> or <i>mistaken
			about</i> a thing, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Sph.</u>
				228e
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περί τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Isoc.
					2.28
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπί τινος πότερον</span> . .
				<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Grg.</u>
				466c
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπέρ τινος</span> Procop.l.c.;
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠμφεγνόουν ὅ τι ἐποίουν</span>
			<i>they knew not</i> what they were about, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
			</span></i>l.c.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐκ ἀμφιγνοῶ σε γεγονότα
				συστρατιώτην</span>
			<i>I am</i> not <i>mistaken in thinking</i> . . , <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Pomp.</u>
				79
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφιγνοηθείς</span>”
				<i>unrecognized,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>HG</u>
					6.5.26
				</span></i>
			; but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφιγνοούμενόν ἐστι</span>
			<i>is in dispute,</i> Air.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Tact.</u>
				6.2
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plot.
				4.4.12
			</span></i>.</div>
